      "createdAt": "2026-09-18T08:37:22.825Z",
      "activities": [
        "$ABC$ un triangle rectangle en $A$ tel que : $BC=5cm$ et $AC = 4cm$.\\nCocher la réponse juste dans tous les cas suivants :",
        "**a)**",
        "$\\square$ $AB = 3cm$",
        "$\\square$ $AB = 4cm$",
        "$\\square$ $AB = 3,5cm$",
        "$\\square$ $AB = 5cm$",
        "**b)**",
        "$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ACB}) = 3/5$",
        "$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ACB}) = 5/3$",
        "$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ACB}) = -5/3$",
        "$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ACB}) = -3/5$",
        "**c)**",
        "$\\square$ $\\cos(\\widehat{ACB}) = 4/5$",
        "$\\square$ $\\cos(\\widehat{ACB}) = 5/4$",
        "$\\square$ $\\cos(\\widehat{ACB}) = -5/4$",
        "$\\square$ $\\cos(\\widehat{ACB}) = -4/5$",
        "**d)**",
        "$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ABC}) = \\tan(\\widehat{ACB})$",
        "$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ACB}) = \\cos(\\widehat{ABC})$",
        "$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ABC}) = \\cos(\\widehat{BAC})$",
        "$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ABC}) = \\tan(\\widehat{ABC})$",
        "• Exercice 7"
      ],
      "customContent": "$ABC$ un triangle rectangle en $A$ tel que : $BC=5cm$ et $AC = 4cm$.\\nCocher la réponse juste dans tous les cas suivants :\n**a)**\n$\\square$ $AB = 3cm$\n$\\square$ $AB = 4cm$\n$\\square$ $AB = 3,5cm$\n$\\square$ $AB = 5cm$\n**b)**\n$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ACB}) = 3/5$\n$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ACB}) = 5/3$\n$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ACB}) = -5/3$\n$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ACB}) = -3/5$\n**c)**\n$\\square$ $\\cos(\\widehat{ACB}) = 4/5$\n$\\square$ $\\cos(\\widehat{ACB}) = 5/4$\n$\\square$ $\\cos(\\widehat{ACB}) = -5/4$\n$\\square$ $\\cos(\\widehat{ACB}) = -4/5$\n**d)**\n$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ABC}) = \\tan(\\widehat{ACB})$\n$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ACB}) = \\cos(\\widehat{ABC})$\n$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ABC}) = \\cos(\\widehat{BAC})$\n$\\square$ $\\sin(\\widehat{ABC}) = \\tan(\\widehat{ABC})$\n• Exercice 7",
      "isHeaderSéance": false,
      "selectedSections": [
